# act defaults for this repo. One argument per line, no comments supported by
# act itself — these lines are for the reader.
#
# `--pull` defaults to true, so every `act` invocation re-checks the runner
# image against the registry. The image is 2.3 GB and it does not change between
# runs, so that is a network round trip for nothing. Pull it once by hand when
# you actually want a newer one:
#
#   docker pull ghcr.io/catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
--pull=false
